    "description": "For aligned rows/labels, construct per-value class histogram h[v,c] and totals a[c]. H(a)=-sum p log2 p with zero terms omitted. In ascending numeric value order compute Q=sum_v n_v/N H(h_v), S=-sum_v n_v/N log2(n_v/N). Return 0 if S<=1e-12, otherwise max(0,(H(a)-Q)/S). Empty input returns zero through the no-partition branch. weights applies this independently at each slot. freq and argmax_tie select maximum (count,prior,-class)."
